From: ReadyNAS NG <readynasng@build>
Subject: [PATCH 16/27] platform: padre: add the fan, LM75 and power button driver

Ported from the GPL 2.6.17 hwmon driver, same interface
(/proc/sys/dev/hwmon, /proc/sys/dev/boot/info, uevent_helper
"powerdown"/"powersave" on the power button).
